致三维角色插画风格，毛发自然，衣料和金属细节清晰。全身正面略侧身站立，右爪轻轻抬起，双臂和双腿结构自然，完整保留头盔、双手和双脚。画面只出现这一只熊猫宇航员，主体居中，四周留出安全空白，轮廓不被裁切。背景以及主体之外的空白区域完全透明，保留细腻的边缘过渡。不要地面、场景、月球、星空、投影、色块、边框或文字，不要把棋盘格绘制到图像里。输出用于透明PNG素材，背景必须是Alpha透明，而不是白底、黑底或棋盘格图案。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "title": "01 主体描述 / 默认熊猫宇航员", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#26333d", "size": [680, 430], "pos": [35, 90], "id": 488, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [685], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "links": [687], "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent", "links": [], "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "color": "#536d92", "widgets_values": ["", "", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 681, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_1", "label": "参考图 1 (Image-1)", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "参考图 1 (Image-1)"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 718, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "negative_prompt"}, "name": "negative_prompt", "label": "negative_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "negative_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution"}], "flags": {}, "type": "TextEncodeQwenImage21", "title": "纯文本条件 / 无参考图", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#26333d", "size": [600, 480], "pos": [1645, 90], "id": 471, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.36.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectabl